# --- guard against the vault-explosion feedback loop -------------------------
# `graphify export obsidian` emits one note per graph node. Aimed at the vault
# ROOT it produced 1,922 derived notes there, burying the real notes, and the
# next run re-indexed those as sources and produced more nodes again. The export
# now targets vault/_graph-view/ from the PRUNED graph, and this keeps the loop
# broken even if someone points it back at the root.
vault/_graph-view/
vault/.graphify_obsidian_manifest.json
vault/_COMMUNITY_*.md
vault/* Module *.md
vault/obsidian-view/
# generated node-name vault notes from obsidian export (loop guard)
# NOTE: this line used to read `vault/(*.md` -- an unbalanced paren that matches
# nothing. It looked like protection and was none.
vault/.obsidian/
# curated code map is generated from code + notes; indexing it would echo the code back
vault/09 - Code Map/
